# ── Databases ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Production data lives in PostgreSQL (DATABASE_URL). Any *.db/*.sqlite3 files
# below are local-dev-only artifacts (or legacy pre-Django scripts) and must
# never be relied on or committed as a source of truth.
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-journal
*.sqlite3-shm
*.sqlite3-wal
*.db
*.db-journal
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# ── Environment / secrets ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key

# ── Node / npm ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.npm/
.pnpm-debug.log*

# ── Internals ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.cache/
.config/
.local/
.agents/
attached_assets/

# ── OS / editor ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ── Zip archives (keep source in git, not the original import zip) ────────────
*.zip

